                <pb facs="1069" n="953" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg953"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 817.51/708.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Jefferson to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Managua</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 29, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Nicaraguan Congress approves contract with bankers and adjourned yesterday.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jefferson</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
